{"id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat.md","title":"Boolean Satisfiability Language","display":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","aliases":["73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","73-df-boolean-satisfiability"],"display":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</span><span>73-df-boolean-satisfiability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-satisfiability — Boolean Satisfiability Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；二进制词、单字符词及拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto p_i\">\\(i\\mapsto p_i\\)</span> 是单射。变量叶子、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 及复合项具有互不相交的构造标记；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee\">\\(\\vee\\)</span> 是相应自由有限语法树的单射构造子。不同标记的构造结果不相等。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为候选项集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是候选二元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}\\)</span> 的右侧显式量化其分量。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 的子句中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\">\\(\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})\\)</span> 为该固定包的分量声明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\subseteq S\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;\\neg\\varphi\\in S)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in S\\;((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\in S\\land(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\in S))\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\subseteq S\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;\\neg\\varphi\\in S)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in S\\;((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\in S\\land(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\in S))\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(\\mathsf{BoolForm})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall S\\;(\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\subseteq S)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(\\mathsf{BoolForm})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall S\\;(\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\subseteq S)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\llbracket p_i\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\nu(p_i)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\llbracket p_i\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\nu(p_i)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\llbracket\\neg\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq1-\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\wedge\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\llbracket\\neg\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq1-\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\wedge\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists b:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(b)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal B=(b,d)\\land d\\circ b=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf{BoolForm}}\\\\\n{}\\land b(\\bot)=000\\land b(\\top)=001\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;b(p_i)=01\\,1^i0)\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;b(\\neg\\varphi)=10\\,b(\\varphi))\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n(b(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)=110\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)\n\\land b(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)=111\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)))\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists b:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(b)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal B=(b,d)\\land d\\circ b=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf{BoolForm}}\\\\\n{}\\land b(\\bot)=000\\land b(\\top)=001\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;b(p_i)=01\\,1^i0)\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;b(\\neg\\varphi)=10\\,b(\\varphi))\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n(b(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)=110\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)\n\\land b(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)=111\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)))\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu=1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu=1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Structural recursion gives a unique truth-value map for every assignment.</li>\n<li>The tags <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"000,001,01,10,110,111\">\\(000,001,01,10,110,111\\)</span> are prefix-separated at constructor boundaries; the unary terminator in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"01\\,1^i0\">\\(01\\,1^i0\\)</span> makes variable indices self-delimiting. Recursive descent therefore encodes and decodes in time linear in the displayed code length, so the coding cannot hide a superpolynomial change of representation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$；二进制词、单字符词及拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\mapsto p_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B=(\\operatorname{bcode},\\operatorname{bdecode})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\cup\\mathsf{Var}\\subseteq S\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in S\\;\\neg\\varphi\\in S)\n\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in S\\;((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\in S\\land(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\in S))\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(\\mathsf{BoolForm})\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall S\\;(\\operatorname{BoolClosed}(S)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\subseteq S)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_\\nu:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\llbracket p_i\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\nu(p_i)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\llbracket\\neg\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq1-\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\wedge\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\},\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\varphi\\vee\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu,\\llbracket\\psi\\rrbracket_\\nu\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists b:\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(b)\\to\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal B=(b,d)\\land d\\circ b=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathsf{BoolForm}}\\\\\n{}\\land b(\\bot)=000\\land b(\\top)=001\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;b(p_i)=01\\,1^i0)\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;b(\\neg\\varphi)=10\\,b(\\varphi))\\\\\n{}\\land(\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\;\n(b(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)=110\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)\n\\land b(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)=111\\,b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)))\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bcode}(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{BoolForm}\\land\n\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\llbracket\\varphi\\rrbracket_\\nu=1\\}","display":true},{"tex":"000,001,01,10,110,111","display":false},{"tex":"01\\,1^i0","display":false}],"bytes":3632,"backlinks":[{"id":"d303539c48e08599","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)$ (canonical prefix coding of Boolean formulas, see [[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]])"},{"id":"b62119f4f9a2bf93","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{BoolCoding}(\\mathcal B)$；$\\mathsf{SAT}_{\\mathcal B}$ 见 [[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}